+   the current helpers. Float only. Frames are 240 samples in 5 sub-frames of
+   48, with no mode header, 144 bits per frame:
+   LSP 9+4, pitch 7+2, voicing 3, gain 4, then per sub-frame 3 bits of pitch
+   gain and 4x5 bits of innovation.
